{"id":"28.0","doc":"T","title":"Overview (from the chip datasheet)","words":96,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"ESP32-S3 includes two standard "},{"t":"block","v":"I2S","id":"i2s"},{"t":"text","v":" interfaces."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"They can operate in master mode or slave mode, in full-duplex mode or half-duplex communication mode, and can be configured to operate with an "},{"t":"num","v":"8-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":", "},{"t":"num","v":"16-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":", "},{"t":"num","v":"24-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":", or "},{"t":"num","v":"32-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" resolution as an input or output channel."}]},{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"BCK clock frequency, from "},{"t":"num","v":"10 kHz","k":"frequency"},{"t":"text","v":" up to "},{"t":"num","v":"40 MHz","k":"frequency"},{"t":"text","v":", is supported."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The I2S interface has a dedicated DMA controller."}]},{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"It supports TDM PCM, TDM MSB alignment, TDM LSB alignment, TDM Phillips, and PDM interface."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Pin assignment: see "},{"t":"xref","id":"C2.3.5","c":[{"t":"text","v":"§2.3.5 Peripheral Pin Assignment"}]},{"t":"text","v":" (datasheet)."}]}]}]}